Cinema lenses-often called movie lenses or cine lenses-are purpose‑built optical instruments designed for professional filmmaking and high‑end video production. Unlike standard photographic lenses, they offer superior optical clarity, T‑stop calibrated apertures for precise light measurement, extended manual focus throws for meticulous pull‑focus work, and gear rings that integrate seamlessly with follow‑focus rigs. Their rugged mechanical construction is engineered to endure the rigorous demands of motion‑picture shoots, from studio soundstages to remote location sets.
